=== F. WHAT THE THIRD STAR RESTS ON: noticing someone waiting, from the kitchen, sloppy, n=300 ===
From the kitchen a customer not yet asked is a count on the tab, with no ring. As set, the bot knows to the second when the badge rose, and the kinds of faces it has seen.
look N goes over once the badge is N seconds old, whoever it is. never does not go over for that at all, and only comes when its hands are free.
